BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Movie
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T160000
UID:6a397c0c8ea300e2631f804b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Friday afternoon family movie screening of Wrec
 k It Ralph (2012).\nAll ages. Drop in program\, no registration required.\
 nRated PG. From Disney: "For decades\, Ralph has played the bad guy in hi
 s popular video game. In a bold move\, he embarks on an action-packed adve
 nture and sets out to prove to everyone that he is a true hero with a big 
 heart. As he explores exciting new worlds\, he teams up with some unlikely
  new friends including feisty misfit Vanellope von Schweetz. Then\, when a
 n evil enemy threatens their world\, Ralph realizes he holds the fate of t
 he entire arcade in his massive hands."
LOCATION:Sanderson\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a397c0c8ea300e2631f804b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
