DESCRIPTION:Participants will learn about the hidden rivers in Toronto and
  explore how our changing cityscape impacts on our waterways and ecosystem
 s. Looking at archival images and current references\, participants will b
 e guided to bring their own stories into our city’s images using materia
 l such as watercolours\, crayons\, playdough\, text\, etc onto colouring p
 ages.\nLed by Shannyn Porter and Ursula Handleigh
