UID:6a2476f2748daf857d5b0d6d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us this Summer at the library for a screening of GOAT mov
 ie.\nThe story follows Will\, a small goat with big dreams who gets a once
 -in-a-lifetime shot to join the pros and play roarball--a high-intensity\,
  co-ed\, full-contact sport dominated by the fastest\, fiercest animals in
  the world. Will's new teammates aren't thrilled about having a little goa
 t on their roster\, but Will is determined to revolutionize the sport and 
 prove once and for all that 'smalls can ball!\nRated PG. 1hr 40mins.\nEngl
 ish Subtitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when available.
LOCATION:Weston\, Youth Hub Area. Main Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2476f2748daf857d5b0d6d
